      "quote": "All observational studies (eg, cross-sectional, cohort, case-control studies, and case series) except for case reports were included. We included studies that reported the prevalence of COVID-19 in HCWs, using either reverse transcription-polymerase chain reaction (RT-PCR) or a serum antibodies assay... We excluded those articles that evaluated HCWs with suspected but not laboratory-confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection.",
