      "chunk_id": "text_4",
      "quote": "We also included studies evaluating the risk factors for SARS-CoV-2 infection and those analyzing the clinical characteristics and outcomes of laboratory-confirmed COVID-19 among HCWs.",
      "reason": "Synthesis groups (prevalence by RT-PCR vs antibodies, risk factors, clinical characteristics/outcomes) are defined and map directly onto the review objectives; text_6 and text_5 confirm grouping for analyses."
    },
